  "content": "\n\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/c72yiPmFS_4?si=8Ah5plY5ecdyT6ND\" width=\"855\" height=\"450\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><em>《沉浸式灯笼》</em> 为 `Accessories` 模组增加了穿戴灯笼的功能，支持动态光照与自定义摆动物理效果！</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172669/description_07ffa204-5555-4f4e-af62-0a714cbd392b.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Txni&labelColor=36633c&color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/ImmersiveLanterns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Github&color=393939&labelColor=666666&style=for-the-badge&logo=Github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=393939&labelColor=fb594a&style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=393939&labelColor=33de61&style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172669/description_8a85bc5f-6502-4f6a-bff8-a2bb83b4efcc.png\"></p>\n<p>厌倦了在副手中选择拿盾牌还是火把了吗？很简单，只需制作一个灯笼，然后蹲下右键点击即可装备到饰品栏位！灯笼会悬挂在你的腰带上，照亮你周围的区域。在游戏中移动时，在第三人称视角下，灯笼会像钟摆一样摆动。</p>\n<p>虽然已有几款模组以类似方式为灯笼添加了动态光照支持，但《沉浸式灯笼》是第一款完全兼容具有自定义动态光照的<strong>Iris 光影包</strong>的模组。例如，当你装备灵魂灯笼并使用 Complementary 光影时，你将获得蓝色光照！</p>\n<p>《沉浸式灯笼》适用于 Forge 和 Fabric 平台的 1.20.1 及 1.21.1+ 版本。在所有平台上，它都依赖于 Accessories 模组和 Sodium/Embeddium 动态光照。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
